# Project Structure

`@lobehub/editor` is a Lexical-based rich text editor for React: a framework-agnostic kernel,
plugins, high-level React components, a headless entry and a read-only renderer. The root
[AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) is the canonical guide; these rules add detail and must not
contradict it.

## Source Layout (`src/`)

| Path                                           | Contents                                                                                                                                 |
| ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| [src/index.ts](mdc:src/index.ts)               | Main entry (`@lobehub/editor`). Re-exports the kernel, every plugin, hotkey types, `enableHotReload` / `disableHotReload`                |
| [src/editor-kernel/](mdc:src/editor-kernel/)   | `kernel.ts` (`Kernel`), `plugin.ts` (`KernelPlugin`), `data-source.ts`, `event.ts`, `utils.ts` (`genServiceId`, ...), `inode/`, `react/` |
| `src/editor-kernel/react/`                     | React glue: `react-context.ts` (`useLexicalComposerContext`), `react-editor.tsx`, `useTranslation.ts`, `useDecorators.tsx`, portals      |
| [src/plugins/](mdc:src/plugins/)               | One folder per plugin (see below)                                                                                                        |
| [src/react/](mdc:src/react/)                   | High-level components and hooks (`@lobehub/editor/react`)                                                                                |
| [src/headless/](mdc:src/headless/)             | `createHeadlessEditor` and `DEFAULT_HEADLESS_EDITOR_PLUGINS` (`@lobehub/editor/headless`)                                                |
| [src/renderer/](mdc:src/renderer/)             | `LexicalRenderer`, `LexicalDiff`, `nodes/`, per-node `renderers/` (`@lobehub/editor/renderer`)                                           |
| [src/codemirror/](mdc:src/codemirror/)         | CodeMirror loader and code-block UI (`@lobehub/editor/codemirror`)                                                                       |
| [src/types/](mdc:src/types/)                   | `kernel.ts` (`IEditor`, `IEditorKernel`, `IEditorPlugin`, `IServiceID`, ...), `hotkey.ts`, `locale.ts`, `global.d.ts`                    |
| [src/const/hotkey.ts](mdc:src/const/hotkey.ts) | `HOTKEYS_REGISTRATION` (default key bindings)                                                                                            |
| [src/locale/index.ts](mdc:src/locale/index.ts) | Default English strings; `ILocaleKeys` is inferred from it                                                                               |
| [src/utils/](mdc:src/utils/)                   | `debug.ts`, `hotkey/` (`registerHotkey.ts`, `parseHotkeys.ts`, `isHotkeyMatch.ts`), `url.ts`, `cx.ts`, `scrollIntoView.ts`, ...          |
| [src/common/](mdc:src/common/)                 | Environment helpers (`canUseDOM.ts`, `sys.ts`)                                                                                           |

### Plugins (`src/plugins/`)

`auto-complete`, `block`, `code`, `codeblock`, `codemirror-block`, `collaboration`,
`collapsible`, `common`, `content-blocks`, `file`, `hr`, `image`, `inode`, `link`,
`link-highlight`, `list`, `litexml`, `markdown`, `math`, `mention`, `slash`, `table`, `toc`,
`toolbar`, `upload`, `virtual-block`, `yjs`.

A typical plugin folder (see [src/plugins/hr/](mdc:src/plugins/hr/)):

```text
src/plugins/<name>/
├── index.ts        # Barrel: commands, kernel plugin, React plugin
├── index.mdx       # Docs page (/components/plugins/<name>)
├── command/        # createCommand + register…Command
├── node/           # Custom Lexical nodes
├── plugin/         # Kernel plugin (index.ts), optional registry.ts / register.ts
├── react/          # React<Name>Plugin.tsx, type.ts, style.ts, index.ts(x)
├── service/        # Optional services (genServiceId tokens)
├── demos/          # Docs demos (index.tsx, ...)
└── __tests__/      # Vitest tests (some older folders use __test__)
```

Not every plugin has every folder; `markdown`, `litexml`, `upload` and `common` mostly provide
services used by other plugins.

### React (`src/react/`)

`ChatInput`, `ChatInputActionBar`, `ChatInputActions`, `CodeLanguageSelect`, `Editor`,
`EditorProvider`, `FloatActions`, `SendButton`, and `hooks/` (`useEditor`, `useEditorState`,
`useSize`). See [src/react/index.ts](mdc:src/react/index.ts) for the public exports.

## Package Entries

`package.json` `exports`: `.`, `./react`, `./react/EditorProvider`, `./headless`,
`./renderer`, `./codemirror`, `./litexml-commands`. Builds are configured in
[tsdown.config.ts](mdc:tsdown.config.ts); a new entry needs both an `exports` entry and a
tsdown `entry`.

## Outside `src/`

- `docs/` + [docs.config.ts](mdc:docs.config.ts): docs site built with `@lobehub/docs-kit`
  (`lobedocs`); `docs/index.tsx` is the home page.
- `packages/codemirror/`: the `@lobehub/codemirror` package.
- `examples/`: collaboration demos (`ai-collaboration-demo`, `collaboration-business-demo`).
- `tests/`: cross-cutting integration tests.
- `scripts/`: `postinstall-lexical-patch.cjs`, `clean.ts`, `yjs-websocket-demo-server.cjs`,
  `verify-node-identity-package.mjs`, ...
- `.agents/skills/`: agent skills (`using-docs-kit`, `building-landing-home`).

## Key Concepts

- **Kernel** (`Kernel`; created internally by `Editor.createEditor()` from `@/editor-kernel`,
  in React via the `useEditor()` hook, on the server via `createHeadlessEditor()`) owns
  plugins, services, themes, hotkeys, decorators and documents
  (`getDocument(type)` / `setDocument(type, content)`).
- **Kernel plugins** extend `KernelPlugin` and are registered with
  `editor.registerPlugin(Plugin, options)`; they are framework-agnostic.
- **React plugins** (`React<Name>Plugin`) only register the kernel plugin and render
  decorators / UI; pass them to `<Editor plugins={[...]} />`, with options via
  `Editor.withProps(ReactXPlugin, { ... })`.
- **Services** are looked up with `kernel.requireService(IServiceId)`; Markdown
  (`IMarkdownShortCutService`), LiteXML (`ILitexmlService`) and upload (`IUploadService`) are
  the common extension points.
